{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志下","commonName":"歷代志下","title":"歷代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"1d3083ee25a929eff6f02adb22f6b1846af8655beae8503d113456603ae82122","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":821},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["聖殿的設備"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["他又製造一座銅壇，長二十肘，寬二十肘，高十肘；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["又鑄一個銅海，樣式是圓的，高五肘，徑十肘，圍三十肘；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["海周圍有野瓜",{"noteId":0},"的樣式，每肘十瓜，共有兩行，是鑄海的時候鑄上的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["有十二隻銅牛馱海：三隻向北，三隻向西，三隻向南，三隻向東；海在牛上，牛尾向內；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["海厚一掌，邊如杯邊，又如百合花，可容三千罷特；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又製造十個盆：五個放在右邊，五個放在左邊，獻燔祭所用之物都洗在其內；但海是為祭司沐浴的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他又照所定的樣式造十個金燈臺，放在殿裏：五個在右邊，五個在左邊；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又造十張桌子，放在殿裏：五張在右邊，五張在左邊；又造一百個金碗；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又建立祭司院和大院，並院門，用銅包裹門扇；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["將海安在殿門的右邊，就是南邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["戶蘭又造了盆、鏟、碗。這樣，他為所羅門王做完了上帝殿的工。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["所造的就是：兩根柱子和柱上兩個如球的頂，並兩個蓋柱頂的網子"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["和四百石榴，安在兩個網子上（每網兩行蓋着兩個柱上如球的頂）。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["盆座和其上的盆，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["海和海下的十二隻牛，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["盆、鏟子、肉鍤子，與耶和華殿裏的一切器皿，都是巧匠戶蘭用光亮的銅為所羅門王造成的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["是在約旦平原疏割和撒利但中間藉膠泥鑄成的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["所羅門製造的這一切甚多，銅的輕重無法可查。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["所羅門又造上帝殿裏的金壇和陳設餅的桌子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["並精金的燈臺和燈盞，可以照例點在內殿前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["燈臺上的花和燈盞，並蠟剪都是金的，且是純金的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["又用精金製造鑷子、盤子、調羹、火鼎。至於殿門和至聖所的門扇，並殿的門扇，都是金子妝飾的。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"野瓜：原文是牛","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}